1315
01:58:14.444 --> 01:58:16.444
Je verjaardagscadeau.

1316
01:58:36.177 --> 01:58:37.828
Ik moest iets doen.

1317
01:58:37.928 --> 01:58:40.467
Je begon zo'n lul te worden.

1318
